{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Opie, the apprentice to the grand maestro of the universe. Something terrible has happened to the music that keeps existence humming and orderly, and Silence is threatening to turn all of everything into a blobby, quiet mess.\u00a0Naturally, Opie is blamed for the entire thing.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths of the Wilds to gather Sound Sprites. Protect them from hungry, ever-expanding Silence. Reconnect the Sound Sprites to the Melodies of the universe (in whatever way suits you) to bring color, shape and groove back to existence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find, Charm and Protect Sound Sprites</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Sprites are little bits of living Sound. As such, Silence tries to swallow them up whenever it gets the chance. Flush out the Sprites, charm them with your flute, and keep them safe as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/835a23acb422fa73db94414ca277befc.poster.avif?t=1773672617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/835a23acb422fa73db94414ca277befc.webm?t=1773672617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/835a23acb422fa73db94414ca277befc.mp4?t=1773672617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear out the Silence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out different instruments you find to deal with the blobby, stubborn Silence blocking your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/7661bb50aa5c0278307f5d545c104b25.poster.avif?t=1773672617\" width=1170 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/7661bb50aa5c0278307f5d545c104b25.webm?t=1773672617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/7661bb50aa5c0278307f5d545c104b25.mp4?t=1773672617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sound Sprite Melody Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve natural puzzles using each Sprite's unique melodic ability. Some Sound Sprites sing and cause things to grow\u2026 others reveal hidden areas\u2026 others reflect sound off of surfaces. Don't be afraid to experiment with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/08e4a51d3df8b2a6f68dd5d19f30abda.poster.avif?t=1773672617\" width=1170 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/08e4a51d3df8b2a6f68dd5d19f30abda.webm?t=1773672617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/08e4a51d3df8b2a6f68dd5d19f30abda.mp4?t=1773672617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Change the world (and the soundtrack) as you play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather enough Sound Sprites, then choose which ones should be plugged back into the Melodies of the Universe. Your choices change the soundtrack, as well as the way the hand-illustrated world comes back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/c8c1e1c948dee65343ddec7589718d0a.poster.avif?t=1773672617\" width=1170 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/c8c1e1c948dee65343ddec7589718d0a.webm?t=1773672617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/c8c1e1c948dee65343ddec7589718d0a.mp4?t=1773672617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985990?t=1773672617","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985990?t=1773672617","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/fd31ab555cbda556f5d63dab40c79c941ec879b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773672617","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/fd31ab555cbda556f5d63dab40c79c941ec879b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773672617","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Opie, the apprentice to the grand maestro of the universe. Something terrible has happened to the music that keeps existence humming and orderly, and Silence is threatening to turn all of everything into a blobby, quiet mess.\u00a0Naturally, Opie is blamed for the entire thing.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths of the Wilds to gather Sound Sprites. Protect them from hungry, ever-expanding Silence. Reconnect the Sound Sprites to the Melodies of the universe (in whatever way suits you) to bring color, shape and groove back to existence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find, Charm and Protect Sound Sprites</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Sprites are little bits of living Sound. As such, Silence tries to swallow them up whenever it gets the chance. Flush out the Sprites, charm them with your flute, and keep them safe as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/835a23acb422fa73db94414ca277befc.poster.avif?t=1773672617\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/835a23acb422fa73db94414ca277befc.webm?t=1773672617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/835a23acb422fa73db94414ca277befc.mp4?t=1773672617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear out the Silence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out different instruments you find to deal with the blobby, stubborn Silence blocking your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/7661bb50aa5c0278307f5d545c104b25.poster.avif?t=1773672617\" width=1170 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/7661bb50aa5c0278307f5d545c104b25.webm?t=1773672617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/extras/7661bb50aa5c0278307f5d545c104b25.mp4?t=1773672617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><