?t=1773672617","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/b1d01b89140d28997ae61c5abcf256c86d5fcbed/ss_b1d01b89140d28997ae61c5abcf256c86d5fcbed.600x338.jpg?t=1773672617"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/8e3b85707929fa1fb632bbee1d6a4ecb3694fd7b/ss_8e3b85707929fa1fb632bbee1d6a4ecb3694fd7b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773672617","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/8e3b85707929fa1fb632bbee1d6a4ecb3694fd7b/ss_8e3b85707929fa1fb632bbee1d6a4ecb3694fd7b.600x338.jpg?t=1773672617"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/d146591fbdc22d4617b3d3f265c326370923e324/ss_d146591fbdc22d4617b3d3f265c326370923e324.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773672617","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985990/d146591fbdc22d4617b3d3f265c326370923e324/ss_d146591fbdc22d4617b3d3f265c326370923e324.600x338.jpg?t=1773672617"}],"short_description":"An adventure game where you play musical instruments instead of swinging swords. Explore the Wilds to gather adorable Sound Sprites, cut through the looming Silence, and rebuild the soundtrack of this hand-illustrated world in whatever way you see fit. No musical ability required!","steam_appid":3985990,"support_info":{"email":"chase@habitat-games.com","url":"https://habitat-games.com/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}